### Feature Pet — UPDATE (PUT) / UPDATE (PATCH)
### Leyenda: SIN AUTH (sin middleware JWT / sin autenticación)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@id = 1

# @name updatePetPut
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/mascotas/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "owner_id": 1,
  "name": "Firulais Actualizado",
  "description": "Labrador adulto",
  "is_active": true
}

###

# @name updatePetPatch
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/mascotas/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Descripción parcial"
}
